      "source": "docs",
      "note": "Permissive default for unknown Anthropic-wire models: budget style (the long-standing form); the provider flips the thinking form when the API says so."
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-3-pro-image",
      "family": "gemini",
      "match": "^gemini-3(?:\\.\\d+)?-pro-image",
      "reasoning": {
        "style": "level",
        "efforts": [
          "high"
        ],
        "off": null
      },
      "sampling": {
        "temperature": "any",
        "topP": true,
        "topK": true,
        "penalties": true,
        "logprobs": true
      },
      "maxTokensParam": "max_tokens",
      "chatTools": {
        "reasoning": "any"
      },
      "source": "docs",
      "note": "Gemini 3 Pro Image accepts only thinkingLevel high. thinkingLevel replaces thinkingBudget (a request with both is a 400); thinking cannot be switched off, so effort none maps to the lowest level the model accepts."
    },
    {
      "id": "gemini-3-image",
      "family": "gemini",
